    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Breach Specialist</h2><p><em>Everything has a seam. Most people just don’t look.</em></p><hr><h3>Rules</h3><p>You gain a rank in Tinkering (thieves’ tools). If you already have it, its rank rises by one instead.</p><p>When you hit an object, door, barrier, or construct with a weapon attack, you may treat the attack as dealing maximum damage to the target’s objects-only resistances (GM adjudication). Once you do, you can’t do so again until the start of your next turn.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ +1 Tinkering. 🃏 Card — the max-damage-vs-objects rider, once per round.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
